@Faceup_HostAddress = http://localhost:5182

### Get user profile
GET {{Faceup_HostAddress}}/api/user/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Update user profile details
PUT {{Faceup_HostAddress}}/api/user/1/profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "bio": "Coffee lover and weekend runner.",
  "address": "123 Main St",
  "work": "Software Engineer",
  "highSchool": "Central High",
  "college": "State University",
  "hobbies": "Running, Reading",
  "phone": "+63-912-345-6789"
}

###

### Upload profile picture
POST {{Faceup_HostAddress}}/api/user/1/profile-picture
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FaceupBoundary

------FaceupBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="image"; filename="profile.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./wwwroot/uploads/.gitkeep
------FaceupBoundary--

###

### Get user posts
GET {{Faceup_HostAddress}}/api/Post?userId=1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create text-only post
POST {{Faceup_HostAddress}}/api/Post
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----FaceupBoundary

------FaceupBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="message"

Hello from Faceup.http
------FaceupBoundary--

###
